<title>USA: TABLE - Cadmus Q4 oper shr $0.25 before item.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Cadmus Q4 oper shr $0.25 before item.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>CADMUS COMMUNICATIONS CORP</p>
<p>				 3 Mos ended 6/30   12 Mos ended 6/30</p>
<p>				  1997	 1996     1997	1996</p>
<p> Net sales		  $96,770  $91,785  $384,942  $336,655</p>
<p>Operating expenses:</p>
