<p>	 (In thousands, except per share data. Unaudited)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 ended June 30 includes a one-time restructuring charge of $12.9 million ($19.9 million pre-tax) or $1.61.</p>
<p>Before the charge, fourth quarter profits were $2.0 million, or $.25 per share, up 33 percent from last year's fourth quarter net income of $1.5 million, or $.19 per share.</p>
